103
00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:26.010
So we know that Oscar was born and grew up in the United States.

104
00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.050
We know that he has a nephew.

105
00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:31.510
He also has an aunt that lives in Carbondale.

106
00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:34.230
And we know that his mother is now in a wheelchair.

107
00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:40.190
