117
00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:12.570
That's one of the things he very much disliked.

118
00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:14.550
Very, very much not a fan.

119
00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:17.830
When Oscar was younger, he wanted to be an actor in commercials.

120
00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:22.230
But as you know, he ends up in the accounting department at Dunder Mifflin.

121
00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:27.970
