He also owns a little Dunder Mifflin stock, we come to find out.

129
00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:52.490
And his nickname in the office is Actually.

130
00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:54.850
We know that Oscar is gay.

131
00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:57.050
He has a longtime boyfriend, Gil.

132
00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.390
And when they break up, he becomes interested in Matt from the warehouse.

133
00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:04.970
