00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:57.630
My BFF thinks it's Phyllis or Angela, but I say no, it's Oscar.

152
00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:01.510
And I have a favorite, or at least a favorite, for right now.

153
00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:03.550
