167
00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:46.890
Love you, ladies.

168
00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.510
And I'm so excited for this episode.

169
00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:52.830
I mean, that's a pretty classic Oscar-throwing shade.

170
00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:53.070
Oh, yeah.

171
00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:53.550
The beard.

172
00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:54.010
The beard.

173
00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:54.870
Yeah, that's pretty great.

174
00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.550
So, Alexandra, you weren't alone in loving the Oscar shade.

