00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:18.310
Oh, we talk with him about that.

182
00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.190
Yeah, right?

183
00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:19.690
Mm-hmm.

184
00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.590
Listen, Oscar Martinez, the character, he knows it.

185
