00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.030
Oh, you're right.

198
00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:53.650
You're right.

199
00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:54.730
That's a combo platter.

200
00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:55.510
Combo platter.

